WildBuzzard corresponding source is published at:

https://github.com/openresearchtools/wildbuzzard

For a release build, use the exact WildBuzzard commit recorded in the
release-set release-manifest.json. That manifest also records the exact commits
for the separately distributed search extensions and command-line packages.
Complete source and build inputs for bundled third-party code are carried in
the repository or in the source and provenance artifacts named by the same
release manifest.

The independently installed buzzard-search, buzzard-minijtt, and
buzzard-torrent releases publish their own license, provenance, and
corresponding-source artifacts. Those sources are not browser payload. The
Arti source archive corresponding to the bundled runtime is distributed next
to the browser packages in the same release set.
